+  /**
+   * @brief Loads a guest RIP with a PC-relative literal load from the multiblock's literal pool
+   *
+   * Falls back to InsertGuestRIPMove when a move is as short, or when the multiblock may be too large for
+   * the +-1MB range of the literal load.
+   *
+   * @param Reg - The GPR to load the guest RIP in to
